- [ ] `marketing-backend` desplegado en Railway con `REDIS_URL` compartido
- [ ] `BullMQ Queue('marketing-attribution')` inyectada en `PaymentsModule`
- [ ] `MARKETING_ATTRIBUTION_QUEUE` constante en `payments.constants.ts`

