- [ ] `public/` copiado al runtime
- [ ] `HOSTNAME=0.0.0.0` en runtime
- [ ] `NEXT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1` en build y runtime
- [ ] Usuario `nextjs` antes del CMD
- [ ] `CMD ["node", "server.js"]`

## Checklist — GitHub Actions

